  <ns0:Ontology rdf:about="http://rds.posccaesar.org/ontology/plm/ont/datasheet">
    <ns3:rights rdf:datatype="&xsd;string" xmlns:ns3="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Copyright POSC Caesar Association</ns3:rights>
    <ns4:creator rdf:resource="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7167-7321" xmlns:ns4="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" />
    <ns5:description rdf:datatype="&xsd;string" xmlns:ns5="http://purl.org/dc/terms/">The Datasheet Ontology is a vocabulary for a "proto-semantic" representation of datasheet contents, intended as a part of the POSC Caesar RDL. The ontology was developed by the DISC collaboration on digitalisation, Q3 2023. Disclaimer: This ontology is based on an earlier, unspecified version of IDO and may include references that are not valid in the latest IDO version. It is published here to give users a starting point and inspiration for how IDO can be applied.</ns5:description>
    <ns6:issued rdf:datatype="&xsd;date" xmlns:ns6="http://purl.org/dc/terms/">2023-09-15</ns6:issued>
    <ns7:license rdf:resource="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/" xmlns:ns7="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" />
    <ns8:modified rdf:datatype="&xsd;date" xmlns:ns8="http://purl.org/dc/terms/">2023-09-15</ns8:modified>
    <ns9:publisher rdf:resource="http://www.posccaesar.org/" xmlns:ns9="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" />
    <ns10:title rdf:datatype="&xsd;string" xmlns:ns10="http://purl.org/dc/terms/">Datasheet Ontology</ns10:title>
    <ns11:lastUpdateOn rdf:datatype="&xsd;dateTime" xmlns:ns11="http://purl.org/pav/">2023-09-15T10:49:05Z</ns11:lastUpdateOn>
    <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">The Datasheet Ontology is a vocabulary for a "proto-semantic" representation of datasheet contents. Disclaimer: This ontology is based on an earlier, unspecified version of IDO. Since parts of IDO have been removed in later releases, this ontology may include references that are not valid in the latest IDO version. It is published here to give users a starting point and inspiration for how IDO can be applied. Your feedback will help us develop updated ontologies aligned with the latest IDO version.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">Datasheet Ontology</rdfs:label>
    <ns0:imports rdf:resource="http://rds.posccaesar.org/ontology/plm/ont/document" />
